  "contract": [
    "Null initial frame owner returns0 without bitmap/flag writes. Otherwise clear all requested started bits before visiting slots, including bits above the20-slot table.",
    "For each requested slot in ascending order, reload the frame owner and read its selected frame word before inspecting the init byte. Call its C deinit provider only when initialized and nonnull; null table slots preserve init bytes.",
    "Stop at the first nonzero signed-byte callback status and return it without clearing that flag. Clear each successful callback flag only after the callback. Honor callback changes to the frame owner/table, init flags and started bitmap.",
    "Project only the deinit column of the locked three-column20-row table into C pointers. The shared soft ADT callback occupies slots9 and15."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "All96 native controller instruction bytes execute. Direct callbacks are modeled with all valid signed-byte statuses, exhaustive six-bit request/init combinations, noncallable/high mask bits and live state mutations. Read/write order and callback-boundary snapshots match.",
    "Actual C integration covers all64 callable-init masks and executes every public callback/descendant with the C allocator. Sixteen additional cases execute the real GH3X2X_AlgoMemConfig caller, controller and memory initializer. No source execution enters stock code.",
    "The dual-soft-slot actual fixture uses a null saved allocation to avoid assuming a valid double release of a shared live allocation. Unrequested initialized algorithms retain their owned allocations and flags.",
    "Initial null owner is supported. A callback-induced late null frame owner reads address4 before the next zero init flag; this is an unmapped emulator access shape, not a physical MCU fault claim. Null frame arguments are forwarded unchanged.",
    "Saved integer/FP registers, SP, masks, FPSCR and caller guards checked. Caller scratch/APSR/private frames excluded. Full RAM comparisons omit the private stack region. Integration primes an active FP context; cold FP activation remains outside proof.",
    "Only the deinit graph is closed. Native algorithm initialization/calculation, physical sensors, concurrency, final executable linking/startup and boot remain open. Relocatable composition is not bootable firmware."
  ],
